  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The resultant equation is<br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8.46</mn></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/eellpxdtkdutjvecblvaircwuzqlttnnrvwjbbeqgarptqvbqm.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br />And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>7.2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8.46</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>11.25</mn></math><br /><br />And <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8.46</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0.85</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>40.4</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><br />Thus, the displacement equation of combined motion is<br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11.25</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40.4</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>",
